WEBVTT

01:49.979 --> 01:53.940
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.410 --> 01:56.759
[Episode 24]

02:04.760 --> 02:05.350
Mom.

02:05.950 --> 02:07.950
Your hands felt so cold to touch.

02:08.280 --> 02:09.710
I'll get you some hot water.

02:09.710 --> 02:10.509
Don't bother.

02:16.000 --> 02:17.860
Come outside with me for a moment.

02:31.840 --> 02:32.520
Where is he?

02:36.120 --> 02:36.910
I don't know.

02:37.030 --> 02:38.560
Maybe he went home.

02:39.360 --> 02:40.360
Stop lying to me.

02:42.520 --> 02:44.920
He arranged this hospital room, didn't he?

02:49.430 --> 02:51.230
How long have you been together?

02:59.910 --> 03:02.440
If it weren't for seeing
this document today,

03:03.470 --> 03:05.670
your dad wouldn't have gotten so angry.

03:06.710 --> 03:07.630
He also wouldn't have rushed out

03:07.630 --> 03:10.030
this late at night to
find you at your place.

03:10.390 --> 03:11.720
He was so furious that

03:13.840 --> 03:15.520
he got hit by a car while
crossing the street

03:15.520 --> 03:17.120
after getting out of his car.

03:20.280 --> 03:20.750
I...

04:12.910 --> 04:14.440
What were those documents?

04:17.089 --> 04:18.680
What did Mrs. Hu mean

04:19.720 --> 04:20.920
by what she just said?

04:25.870 --> 04:26.680
Back then,

04:28.250 --> 04:29.770
when did you...

04:30.800 --> 04:32.070
leave Shanghai

04:32.870 --> 04:34.000
and go to America?

04:39.560 --> 04:41.159
On the night of the accident,

04:41.920 --> 04:43.180
my father passed away.

04:44.360 --> 04:45.620
After a hasty funeral,

04:45.800 --> 04:47.040
I was sent away.

04:56.720 --> 04:57.830
At that time,

05:00.870 --> 05:02.270
my father never woke up,

05:03.870 --> 05:05.190
just like today.

05:13.390 --> 05:14.310
Xiao Zhiyu.

05:16.160 --> 05:17.190
I don't blame you

05:17.190 --> 05:18.790
for hiding the truth from me.

05:22.560 --> 05:23.560
It's just that...

05:29.480 --> 05:31.310
I shouldn't have fallen for you.

05:34.600 --> 05:36.070
W-What do you mean?

05:41.240 --> 05:42.570
Back then, my father was

05:43.390 --> 05:44.950
the lighting engineer

05:45.610 --> 05:47.000
of Xincheng Stadium.

05:52.720 --> 05:56.350
♪ Midnight ♪

05:57.240 --> 06:02.300
♪ I see stars fly ♪

06:03.690 --> 06:09.040
♪ As they fall to Earth ♪

06:10.050 --> 06:17.450
♪ Lighting up this moment ♪

06:14.870 --> 06:17.160
My father and his construction team

06:18.130 --> 06:20.450
♪ You outshine the stars ♪

06:18.340 --> 06:20.380
were trapped under the rubble.

06:20.970 --> 06:23.700
♪ And hold them in your palm ♪

06:22.360 --> 06:24.270
Back then, I waited for him to wake up,

06:24.140 --> 06:27.170
♪ Now we've made a way ♪

06:25.390 --> 06:26.790
just like how I did today.

06:27.780 --> 06:31.200
♪ Now we're at the edge ♪

06:28.120 --> 06:29.750
But after waking up,

06:31.220 --> 06:33.220
♪ Tomorrow and today ♪

06:31.390 --> 06:32.680
everything changed.

06:34.090 --> 06:36.700
♪ Now in every way ♪

06:36.720 --> 06:41.810
♪ The world draws still ♪

06:42.300 --> 06:46.700
♪ I wish for you ♪

06:48.350 --> 06:53.880
♪ I wish for you ♪

06:54.390 --> 07:00.880
♪ Look up at the moon
and reach for my hand ♪

07:00.900 --> 07:04.690
♪ Oh I wish for you ♪

07:09.380 --> 07:18.730
♪ I've been always chasing ♪

07:20.430 --> 07:25.040
♪ Facing every moment, time after time ♪

07:25.450 --> 07:30.280
♪ You bring me to life again ♪

07:30.980 --> 07:33.380
♪ Again ♪

07:31.320 --> 07:35.050
[Attestation: This certifies that Xiao Zhiyu,
a resident of my jurisdiction, was formerly known as Qin Xiaoyi.]

07:33.400 --> 07:37.990
♪ I wish for you ♪

07:39.610 --> 07:45.210
♪ I wish for you ♪

07:45.820 --> 07:52.190
♪ Look up at the moon
and reach for my hand ♪

07:52.220 --> 07:56.860
♪ Oh I wish for you ♪

08:21.800 --> 08:22.560
Hello.

08:22.760 --> 08:24.760
[The number you've dialled is...]

08:26.140 --> 08:27.820
[Huang Yide]

08:39.870 --> 08:40.750
Has Huang Yide

08:41.150 --> 08:42.809
tried to contact me recently?

08:43.440 --> 08:44.200
Chairman Pei,

08:44.200 --> 08:45.440
Mr. Huang hasn't been here.

08:45.440 --> 08:46.240
As you instructed,

08:46.240 --> 08:47.750
we've blocked his calls, texts,

08:47.750 --> 08:48.910
and emails.

09:02.810 --> 09:04.960
[Building Materials Purchase
and Supply Contract]

09:32.970 --> 09:35.010
Find Huang Yide for me immediately.

09:42.440 --> 09:43.760
How many days will

09:43.790 --> 09:44.850
this SIM card last?

09:45.480 --> 09:46.030
This one?

09:46.840 --> 09:47.440
Five days,

09:47.600 --> 09:48.400
with 7GB data.

09:48.600 --> 09:49.790
It's a pretty good deal.

09:49.790 --> 09:51.150
7GB, huh?

09:53.910 --> 09:54.770
Want to get one?

09:59.980 --> 10:01.310
Are you out of your mind?

10:29.000 --> 10:29.720
Kanghua.

10:30.720 --> 10:31.510
Kanghua.

10:32.580 --> 10:33.710
Have you heard about

10:33.720 --> 10:34.850
Zhiyu's situation?

10:35.360 --> 10:36.670
Why was this matter suddenly exposed?

10:36.670 --> 10:37.440
What should we do?

10:37.440 --> 10:38.360
Don't worry.

10:38.400 --> 10:40.780
I've already hired people to
suppress the attention.

10:40.780 --> 10:43.640
I didn't wake you because
I didn't want you to worry.

10:44.700 --> 10:45.700
Rest assured,

10:45.720 --> 10:47.250
I'll handle this matter.

10:49.550 --> 10:50.910
I've kept it hidden for so many years.

10:50.910 --> 10:52.120
I thought it was all behind me,

10:52.120 --> 10:53.320
and that no one would
ever mention it again.

10:53.320 --> 10:55.030
Things are different now.

10:55.310 --> 10:57.150
Information spreads quickly online.

10:57.150 --> 10:58.360
Zhiyu is so outstanding.

10:58.360 --> 11:00.390
This was bound to be
exposed sooner or later.

11:00.390 --> 11:01.600
You're not wearing enough.

11:01.600 --> 11:02.930
Go put on another layer.

11:03.270 --> 11:04.070
Morning, Dad,

11:04.210 --> 11:04.810
Mrs. Xiao.

11:07.210 --> 11:09.210
I need to check on how Zhiyu's doing.

11:40.480 --> 11:41.240
I'm fine.

11:51.170 --> 11:57.180
[Outpatient]

12:07.670 --> 12:08.930
It's nothing serious.

12:09.030 --> 12:10.080
All vital signs

12:10.270 --> 12:11.390
are normal too.

12:11.910 --> 12:13.200
It's just that for today,

12:13.200 --> 12:15.270
the wound will hurt more than yesterday.

12:15.270 --> 12:16.550
He'll need painkillers.

12:16.550 --> 12:17.100
Okay.

12:17.120 --> 12:18.450
Alright, get some rest.

12:19.080 --> 12:19.720
Okay.

12:20.000 --> 12:20.750
Thank you, doctor.

12:20.750 --> 12:21.440
Thanks.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.170
Have a seat, Mom.

12:35.030 --> 12:36.630
You've been up all night too.

12:36.750 --> 12:38.210
Go home and get some sleep.

12:39.030 --> 12:39.830
I'm not tired.

12:40.590 --> 12:42.440
But I really do need to make a trip home.

12:42.440 --> 12:44.440
We didn't pack anything for
this hospitalization.

12:44.440 --> 12:45.510
Xiaorou will be here soon.

12:45.510 --> 12:46.960
She'll keep you company for a while.

12:46.960 --> 12:48.160
I'll head home first.

13:00.150 --> 13:01.150
I understand.

13:02.110 --> 13:03.340
Everything will be okay.

13:03.340 --> 13:05.030
Uncle Hu will be fine.

13:08.750 --> 13:09.390
Zhao.

13:09.720 --> 13:11.580
I'm going back to get some things.

13:11.670 --> 13:13.270
Could you keep an eye on things here?

13:13.270 --> 13:14.000
Don't worry.

13:14.120 --> 13:14.910
Take it easy.

13:15.870 --> 13:16.530
I'll be off.

13:16.960 --> 13:17.670
Take care.

13:30.450 --> 13:32.120
Is there an emergency at the company?

13:32.120 --> 13:32.520
Wait.

13:33.250 --> 13:34.990
Our boss has been exposed in
such a big scandal.

13:34.990 --> 13:36.450
Isn't that urgent enough?

13:37.320 --> 13:39.860
So, the urgent matter you mentioned
is just some gossip?

13:39.860 --> 13:40.930
No, that's not it.

13:40.960 --> 13:41.510
Early this morning,

13:41.510 --> 13:43.390
many clients came asking questions.

13:43.390 --> 13:45.240
They want to know if the rumors
about Mr. Xiao are true.

13:45.240 --> 13:46.360
This scandal has created quite a stir.

13:46.360 --> 13:48.080
We definitely need to respond.

13:48.080 --> 13:49.960
And of all times, Mr. Xiao disappeared at
this critical moment.

13:49.960 --> 13:52.020
Even Ms. Zhou had called me directly.

13:52.320 --> 13:53.080
Sun.

13:53.390 --> 13:54.920
I need to take a few days off.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.920
I'm taking care of my father
at the hospital.

13:56.920 --> 13:59.050
I'll need to brief you on some matters.

14:21.360 --> 14:22.280
Where are you going?

14:22.280 --> 14:23.410
I'll give you a ride.

14:24.390 --> 14:25.320
No need.

14:25.790 --> 14:27.630
With all that's going on,
why are you still here?

14:27.630 --> 14:29.830
Haven't you seen the online discourse?

14:31.480 --> 14:33.340
You're more important right now.

14:35.940 --> 14:37.200
So where are you going?

14:37.520 --> 14:38.650
I'll give you a ride.

14:41.330 --> 14:41.900
No need.

15:15.790 --> 15:17.790
Since you're so eager to drive me...

15:18.550 --> 15:19.150
Fine.

15:20.590 --> 15:22.390
I need to go to my parents' house.

16:33.350 --> 16:34.010
We're here.

16:40.950 --> 16:42.150
Come with me for a bit.

17:52.640 --> 17:53.970
The man next to my father

17:55.030 --> 17:57.030
is the lightning crew's foreman,

17:58.200 --> 17:59.130
Uncle Han Chuan.

18:02.250 --> 18:04.510
He's three years younger than my father.

18:04.550 --> 18:05.680
My father treats him

18:05.830 --> 18:07.110
like his own brother.

18:07.670 --> 18:09.870
He took him along looking for projects,

18:09.930 --> 18:11.330
and even found him dates.

18:12.350 --> 18:14.150
Uncle Han often came to our home.

18:15.570 --> 18:17.370
His cooking was delicious.

18:18.000 --> 18:18.880
Every time he brought food,

18:18.880 --> 18:20.680
I could eat nearly an extra bowl.

18:23.270 --> 18:25.070
My dad's signature dishes

18:25.550 --> 18:27.350
were all learned from Uncle Han.

18:28.720 --> 18:30.650
He was really good at cooking fish.

18:34.200 --> 18:34.960
That year,

18:35.790 --> 18:37.320
my dad took on the stadium's

18:37.550 --> 18:38.750
lighting project.

18:40.110 --> 18:42.110
Uncle Han's wife was pregnant then.

18:42.400 --> 18:44.000
He had originally planned

18:44.400 --> 18:45.330
to take time off.

18:47.480 --> 18:48.940
But in order to help my dad,

18:50.160 --> 18:51.820
he still joined him in the end.

19:02.310 --> 19:03.920
All those happy days

19:06.410 --> 19:07.850
ended on that day.

19:21.670 --> 19:23.310
I was only 4 or 5 years old then.

19:23.310 --> 19:25.440
The reason I know all this so clearly

19:26.110 --> 19:28.200
is because for over twenty years,

19:28.680 --> 19:30.540
my dad has kept talking about him,

19:30.680 --> 19:32.480
mentioning him again and again.

19:33.510 --> 19:34.480
It's almost like

19:35.720 --> 19:37.520
as long as we remember Uncle Han,

19:38.440 --> 19:40.160
he never really left us.

19:45.160 --> 19:46.030
Every year,

19:46.200 --> 19:48.400
our family will visit his grave,

19:49.400 --> 19:50.480
rain or shine.

19:51.440 --> 19:53.100
My dad has always felt guilty.

19:54.510 --> 19:56.160
He has never forgotten the past,

19:56.160 --> 19:57.480
nor did he ever forget

19:58.000 --> 19:59.030
that accident.

20:03.200 --> 20:04.400
But last night,

20:05.680 --> 20:06.680
because of me,

20:08.040 --> 20:09.930
he was deeply hurt again.

20:19.310 --> 20:20.720
I had you bring me here

20:21.830 --> 20:23.430
just to tell you all this.

20:32.070 --> 20:33.030
These days

20:34.030 --> 20:35.490
have been pure happiness.

20:36.750 --> 20:38.400
It felt like a dream.

20:40.590 --> 20:42.350
I felt like I had it all.

20:43.270 --> 20:45.800
It was as though life
couldn't get any better.

20:49.480 --> 20:50.400
Sure enough,

20:51.350 --> 20:52.240
the heavens

20:53.680 --> 20:55.160
are still

20:56.240 --> 20:57.970
waiting to make a mockery of me.

21:10.030 --> 21:10.840
Xiao Zhiyu,

21:18.200 --> 21:19.060
let's break up.

21:19.950 --> 21:23.110
♪ Fireworks scatter across the sky ♪

21:23.480 --> 21:27.610
♪ And the faint light in my eyes
fades with them ♪

21:29.560 --> 21:32.860
♪ Just like the end of our story ♪

21:33.140 --> 21:35.030
♪ Who says ♪

21:35.690 --> 21:40.060
♪ We meet just to say goodbye? ♪

21:40.890 --> 21:45.830
♪ Who's to blame for a fate like this? ♪

21:47.230 --> 21:49.980
♪ Walking across ♪

21:51.180 --> 21:56.730
♪ This hollow bridge of fate ♪

21:58.010 --> 22:03.230
♪ If you can't see the other shore,
just look up ♪

22:04.470 --> 22:06.680
♪ Only a few stars shine ♪

22:08.000 --> 22:11.170
♪ It's true ♪

22:11.550 --> 22:14.830
♪ I miss you ♪

22:14.890 --> 22:21.130
♪ Hope the dream brings me to you ♪

22:22.670 --> 22:25.310
♪ And I also know ♪

22:25.910 --> 22:32.260
♪ The night will pass
and I have to part with you ♪

22:32.980 --> 22:41.160
♪ It's hard to accept but true ♪

22:42.730 --> 22:48.970
♪ Hope the night brings me to you ♪

22:50.340 --> 22:52.980
♪ And I also know ♪

22:53.570 --> 22:59.920
♪ The dreams are false
and I should forget you ♪

23:00.770 --> 23:10.270
♪ It's hard to accept but true ♪

23:17.160 --> 23:17.790
Dad?

23:19.510 --> 23:20.160
Dad...

23:21.600 --> 23:22.790
How are you feeling?

23:23.960 --> 23:25.200
Does it hurt a lot?

23:26.110 --> 23:26.630
Dad!

23:30.680 --> 23:31.240
Dad.

23:36.600 --> 23:37.800
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

23:39.030 --> 23:39.830
I'm sorry.

23:40.920 --> 23:41.750
I'm sorry!

23:43.450 --> 23:44.690
I'm sorry!

23:45.720 --> 23:46.720
I'm sorry.

23:47.440 --> 23:48.270
Don't cry.

23:49.440 --> 23:50.120
Don't cry.

23:53.270 --> 23:54.400
It's not your fault.

23:56.030 --> 23:56.790
I know.

23:58.440 --> 24:00.640
I can't force you to make any decisions.

24:04.510 --> 24:06.350
It's just that I owe Uncle Han

24:06.350 --> 24:07.480
far too much.

24:12.840 --> 24:14.170
When I meet him someday,

24:17.050 --> 24:19.050
I won't know how to explain it to him.

24:43.920 --> 24:45.000
Xiao Zhiyu!

24:45.400 --> 24:46.070
Hurry up!

24:46.070 --> 24:47.600
The movie is about to start!

24:47.720 --> 24:48.680
Hurry, hurry!

24:49.900 --> 24:50.650
Hurry up!

25:58.480 --> 25:59.830
Regarding the rumors circulating online,

25:59.830 --> 26:01.960
I would like to formally address them.

26:02.110 --> 26:03.790
My father is indeed Qin Yuze.

26:05.270 --> 26:07.790
I sincerely apologize for
any inconvenience

26:07.790 --> 26:09.120
caused to our partners.

26:10.680 --> 26:11.940
I promise here and now,

26:13.060 --> 26:15.030
if there are any concerns about
our cooperation,

26:15.030 --> 26:16.270
I will personally

26:16.640 --> 26:18.440
bear the corresponding losses.

26:18.770 --> 26:20.010
This concludes my statement.

26:20.010 --> 26:20.620
Thank you.

26:26.660 --> 26:29.770
No wonder Xiao never mentions his father.

26:30.510 --> 26:32.880
He was just a child
when the accident happened.

26:32.880 --> 26:34.240
What could he have done?

26:36.930 --> 26:39.190
He must be having a rough time these days.

26:40.720 --> 26:42.110
Xiao hasn't been

26:42.200 --> 26:43.930
answering my calls these days.

26:44.000 --> 26:45.750
Hu Xiu must know what's going on, right?

26:45.750 --> 26:47.210
Did she tell you anything?

26:48.750 --> 26:49.680
Or how about this?

26:49.680 --> 26:50.960
You contact Hu Xiu,

26:50.960 --> 26:52.090
and we'll go check on

26:52.190 --> 26:53.110
Xiao together.

26:53.920 --> 26:56.450
I don't have time to worry about him
right now.

26:56.550 --> 26:59.110
He's your best friend's boyfriend
at the very least.

26:59.110 --> 27:02.400
How can you be so indifferent when
something like this happens?

27:02.400 --> 27:03.550
Boyfriend?

27:03.750 --> 27:05.210
That's questionable now.

27:06.790 --> 27:07.720
What do you mean?

27:09.350 --> 27:10.830
Don't tell me that

27:10.960 --> 27:11.890
Hu Xiu is going to

27:12.000 --> 27:13.730
dump Xiao just because of this?

27:15.550 --> 27:16.640
This is exactly when

27:16.640 --> 27:18.680
he needs support the most.

27:18.880 --> 27:20.350
Is Hu Xiu really that cold-hearted?

27:20.350 --> 27:20.790
More—

27:21.240 --> 27:22.200
Moreover,

27:22.310 --> 27:24.110
his father's incident happened
so many years ago.

27:24.110 --> 27:25.720
Why is Hu Xiu enforcing
punishment by association?

27:25.720 --> 27:27.070
Who's being cold-hearted?

27:27.070 --> 27:29.800
Don't talk nonsense if
you don't know any better.

27:30.680 --> 27:32.310
Anyway, Xiao hasn't done anything wrong.

27:32.310 --> 27:34.570
And Hu Xiu has done nothing wrong either.

27:34.720 --> 27:35.270
Get out of here.

27:35.270 --> 27:37.030
Don't get in the way of my business.

27:37.030 --> 27:37.510
How annoying.

27:37.510 --> 27:38.880
W-Why should I leave?

27:38.880 --> 27:40.270
I came here for coffee.

27:40.400 --> 27:42.060
Who asked you to speak for him?

27:43.480 --> 27:44.030
What's going on?

27:44.030 --> 27:45.590
Are you going to punish me with him too?

27:45.590 --> 27:46.160
Yes.

27:47.240 --> 27:47.840
You are...

28:18.160 --> 28:19.420
Mr. Xiao, you're here.

28:19.640 --> 28:20.550
Good morning.

28:32.750 --> 28:33.810
Morning, Mr. Xiao.

28:34.680 --> 28:36.010
Good morning, Mr. Xiao.

28:37.070 --> 28:37.640
Mr. Xiao,

28:38.680 --> 28:41.740
will you be attending the design meeting
this morning?

28:42.680 --> 28:44.350
Here are the preliminary plans
for several projects.

28:44.350 --> 28:46.480
You can take a look before the meeting.

28:48.240 --> 28:48.960
Well then...

28:48.960 --> 28:50.690
Mr. Xiao, I will leave you to it.

29:28.480 --> 29:29.160
I'm sorry.

29:31.830 --> 29:33.890
You always catch people by surprise.

29:34.630 --> 29:35.690
After working with you for so long,

29:35.690 --> 29:36.950
I've gotten used to it.

29:42.160 --> 29:44.890
You haven't had a good rest these days,
am I right?

29:46.200 --> 29:48.060
Things aren't that bad right now.

29:48.070 --> 29:49.550
Everyone is addressing and resolving

29:49.550 --> 29:51.680
our client's questions and concerns.

29:52.000 --> 29:53.750
We let our work speak for itself.

29:53.750 --> 29:56.480
Projects have not yet been
impacted at this time.

29:57.880 --> 29:58.720
And you!

29:59.240 --> 30:01.440
You've been shouldering everything
by yourself,

30:01.440 --> 30:02.770
trying to be a lone hero.

30:03.440 --> 30:04.310
Don't forget,

30:04.720 --> 30:06.790
you have the entire studio behind you.

30:06.790 --> 30:08.750
Five years of understanding and trust

30:08.750 --> 30:11.280
cannot be so easily shattered
by past events.

30:17.550 --> 30:18.150
Thank you.

30:20.330 --> 30:21.410
What did Lyman say?

30:23.400 --> 30:25.880
Mr. Xie said he wants to
talk to you in person.

30:36.550 --> 30:37.350
Mr. Pei.

30:40.960 --> 30:42.020
How is your father?

30:44.110 --> 30:45.710
The surgery was successful,

30:45.720 --> 30:47.200
but he still can't get out of bed.

30:47.200 --> 30:48.330
He just fell asleep.

30:50.310 --> 30:52.070
Then I shall not go in and disturb him.

30:52.070 --> 30:53.470
I brought him some gifts.

31:00.960 --> 31:01.960
I've been messaging you these days,

31:01.960 --> 31:03.030
but you didn't reply.

31:03.030 --> 31:04.160
I was quite worried,

31:04.720 --> 31:05.720
so I asked Ms. Zhao

31:06.270 --> 31:08.070
and found out about your father.

31:10.590 --> 31:11.270
Have a seat.

31:23.160 --> 31:25.200
You aren't getting much rest
these days, have you?

31:25.200 --> 31:26.800
Your eyes are all bloodshot.

31:28.240 --> 31:29.970
I'm just glad my father is okay.

31:35.260 --> 31:36.860
This is a pretty good lawyer.

31:36.930 --> 31:39.160
You can contact him to get compensation
from the driver responsible.

31:39.160 --> 31:41.200
I've already made the introductions.

31:41.200 --> 31:42.270
No need, thank you.

31:42.830 --> 31:44.020
The accident isn't complicated,

31:44.020 --> 31:45.830
and the other party is being cooperative.

31:45.830 --> 31:46.960
As for the compensation,

31:46.960 --> 31:48.230
I can handle it myself

31:48.270 --> 31:49.670
once my dad becomes well.

31:57.490 --> 31:58.620
Have you seen what's

31:59.270 --> 32:00.330
happening online?

32:07.990 --> 32:09.320
So you and Xiao Zhiyu...

32:13.030 --> 32:14.760
Mr. Pei, if you have questions,

32:15.160 --> 32:16.620
please just ask directly.

32:20.750 --> 32:21.750
About him...

32:23.310 --> 32:25.170
I'm sorry for keeping it from you.

32:25.720 --> 32:28.780
After all, what happened back then
was quite a scandal.

32:28.790 --> 32:30.940
His father committed suicide
out of fear of punishment,

32:30.940 --> 32:32.740
leaving behind a complete mess.

32:33.630 --> 32:36.160
He and his mother left the country
soon after.

32:36.880 --> 32:38.410
The Pei family chose to help

32:39.240 --> 32:41.240
out of our long-standing friendship.

32:41.240 --> 32:42.000
But him?

32:44.350 --> 32:46.010
He's never been appreciative

32:46.680 --> 32:47.550
of our help.

32:49.160 --> 32:50.030
My father and I

32:50.110 --> 32:52.310
still harbor quite a bit of resentment.

32:56.160 --> 32:57.440
You were kept in the dark by him.

32:57.440 --> 32:58.310
Being upset

32:58.920 --> 32:59.880
is only natural.

33:03.000 --> 33:04.310
Changing his name,

33:04.750 --> 33:05.920
hiding his past -

33:06.440 --> 33:08.100
these weren't his decisions.

33:13.110 --> 33:14.560
He was so young at that time.

33:14.560 --> 33:17.020
It couldn't have been decided
by him, right?

33:17.960 --> 33:19.220
But what his father did

33:19.440 --> 33:20.270
left a profound impact.

33:20.270 --> 33:22.670
Even if his father had made
a terrible mistake,

33:22.670 --> 33:24.530
what does that have to do with him?

33:25.710 --> 33:27.940
It was his father who caused
your father to be disabled.

33:27.940 --> 33:29.140
Does that not matter?

33:37.480 --> 33:38.210
So it's true.

33:39.370 --> 33:40.430
You knew all along.

33:46.340 --> 33:48.150
The revelation about his background

33:48.150 --> 33:50.480
was circulated by you, Mr. Pei, wasn't it?

33:55.280 --> 33:56.880
What I said is just the truth.

33:57.160 --> 33:58.140
I haven't hidden anything.

33:58.140 --> 33:59.820
But you're far from innocent.

34:03.400 --> 34:04.880
Take these gifts back.

34:05.520 --> 34:07.850
My father wouldn't accept your kindness.

34:40.230 --> 34:40.840
Mr. Xie,

34:42.030 --> 34:43.560
whatever you plan you have,

34:43.710 --> 34:44.590
I'll accept it.

34:48.280 --> 34:49.630
Your father and I

34:50.150 --> 34:51.510
met while fishing.

34:53.670 --> 34:55.550
I had just returned to start a business

34:55.550 --> 34:56.880
and had no connections.

34:57.710 --> 34:59.910
Your father, however, was in his prime.

35:00.760 --> 35:01.840
He happened to catch

35:01.840 --> 35:03.840
the infrastructure boom in China.

35:04.280 --> 35:06.210
There were so many opportunities.

35:08.150 --> 35:09.400
He has always been

35:09.800 --> 35:11.400
very generous with his help.

35:11.840 --> 35:12.630
I had no idea

35:13.360 --> 35:15.620
my father had such a connection with you.

35:16.760 --> 35:17.880
He told me

35:18.630 --> 35:19.710
that good design

35:20.280 --> 35:21.760
gives a building its soul.

35:22.400 --> 35:23.630
Only such buildings

35:24.000 --> 35:26.000
can withstand the test of time.

35:27.670 --> 35:28.840
Those words of his

35:29.590 --> 35:31.120
had a profound impact on me.

35:32.470 --> 35:34.000
It's no wonder I felt

35:34.280 --> 35:36.510
his presence in you the moment I met you.

35:37.710 --> 35:39.910
You two really do take after each other.

35:45.660 --> 35:46.710
Your opinion

35:47.630 --> 35:48.800
means a lot to me.

35:54.670 --> 35:55.550
Actually,

35:56.830 --> 35:58.270
I've been curious about

35:58.800 --> 36:00.330
how your knowledge of Forma

36:01.580 --> 36:03.110
seems unusually thorough.

36:03.760 --> 36:05.620
Otherwise, how could you have detected

36:05.620 --> 36:07.750
their financial problems in advance?

36:08.030 --> 36:09.030
Are you...

36:12.510 --> 36:13.190
Never mind.

36:14.840 --> 36:16.040
I asked you here today

36:16.320 --> 36:17.380
to let you know that

36:17.710 --> 36:20.170
there will be no changes to
Lyman's project.

36:21.550 --> 36:24.280
While it's true I invited you today
to catch up,

36:25.960 --> 36:27.360
my decision to choose you

36:27.710 --> 36:30.040
was never because you were someone's son.

36:50.150 --> 36:50.840
Sun.

36:51.560 --> 36:52.120
Hu Xiu,

36:52.400 --> 36:53.660
the latest news is that

36:53.780 --> 36:55.980
Lyman's project hasn't been affected.

36:57.990 --> 36:58.920
That's great!

37:00.480 --> 37:01.110
So,

37:02.550 --> 37:03.280
um...

37:03.720 --> 37:05.990
how is Mr. Xiao doing?

37:06.550 --> 37:07.750
He came to the office,

37:08.040 --> 37:09.230
but he didn't seem in the best of spirits.

37:09.230 --> 37:10.000
But don't worry,

37:10.000 --> 37:11.710
we've done exactly as you said.

37:11.710 --> 37:13.550
When we see him,
we act like nothing has happened,

37:13.550 --> 37:14.510
we make no fuss,

37:14.760 --> 37:16.760
and we didn't gossip behind his back.

37:16.760 --> 37:17.360
Good.

37:18.270 --> 37:19.500
At least he knows

37:19.520 --> 37:21.580
that all of you are standing with him.

37:23.040 --> 37:24.280
How are things on your end?

37:24.280 --> 37:25.880
When will you be back at work?

37:28.070 --> 37:29.150
I'm...

37:29.150 --> 37:30.590
not sure yet.

37:31.800 --> 37:32.330
Alright.

37:32.670 --> 37:33.660
Remember to update me

37:33.660 --> 37:34.960
with the project materials.

37:34.960 --> 37:36.480
Project materials...

37:39.870 --> 37:42.470
You'll have to wait as I need to
go get my laptop.

37:42.670 --> 37:43.230
Okay.

39:42.370 --> 39:44.040
There's a girl at your place.

39:45.670 --> 39:46.150
Mom,

39:46.180 --> 39:47.500
please ask her to wait.

39:53.080 --> 39:55.030
You're from Zhiyu's studio, right?

39:55.030 --> 39:56.230
I've seen you before.

39:57.070 --> 39:57.760
Yes.

39:58.030 --> 39:59.480
I'm Zhiyu's mother.

40:01.400 --> 40:02.280
I know.

40:06.280 --> 40:06.960
Mrs. Xiao,

40:07.480 --> 40:08.880
If there's nothing else,

40:09.760 --> 40:10.740
I'll be going now.

40:10.740 --> 40:11.490
Wait.

40:12.590 --> 40:14.550
You're here to meet Zhiyu,

40:14.580 --> 40:15.710
but he's not back yet.

40:15.710 --> 40:17.310
Why don't you wait for him a bit longer?

40:17.310 --> 40:17.940
No need.

40:19.230 --> 40:21.160
I'm just here to pick something up.

40:22.630 --> 40:23.230
By the way,

40:23.720 --> 40:25.510
you know Zhen too, right?

40:27.840 --> 40:29.320
We've worked together.

40:30.950 --> 40:32.790
So you and Zhiyu are...

40:42.070 --> 40:44.320
Mrs. Xiao, I need to go now.

40:44.960 --> 40:46.280
Mr. Xiao, I'm here to get my laptop.

40:46.280 --> 40:47.280
Please excuse me.

40:48.660 --> 40:50.550
I haven't formally introduced you yet.

40:50.550 --> 40:52.470
I've already greeted Mrs. Xiao.

40:57.230 --> 40:59.160
Let me make a proper introduction.

40:59.480 --> 41:00.230
This is my mother,

41:00.230 --> 41:00.960
Xiao Wanyue.

41:03.720 --> 41:04.190
Mom,

41:05.590 --> 41:06.590
this is Hu Xiu.

41:09.920 --> 41:10.840
She's the person I love.
